```

3.
```c++
sub_viewport->set_msaa_3d(supported_msaa_method);
```
1 is explicit
2 is explicit in another way
3 saved instructions, but less explicit

And I was thinking of if anyone needs to read this code with fresh eyes, which would be better. But maybe I was over complicating things, either should serve well. Might go with 3 as it serves most well as a cache.

